This project uses stele to keep coding agents to its rules. Create and change files only with apply_patch, never through the shell: no {{.Examples}}. Before an apply_patch, stele shows you the project's rules for its files; after it, stele checks what you wrote. A file written through the shell skips both. This is only about writing: read, search and run commands in the shell as usual, for example {{.Reads}}.
